```mermaid
---
title: Unified Cluster Assignment Pipeline (AssignmentGate)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Svc as ClusteringService
    participant RepDisc as RepresentativeDiscovery
    participant CentDisc as CentroidDiscovery
    participant GraphDisc as GraphDiscovery (HDBSCAN/CW)
    participant Gate as AssignmentGate
    participant Checks as Validation Checks
    participant Writer as AssignmentWriter
    participant Suggest as SuggestionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Svc: All paths converge at AssignmentGate

    Svc->>Svc: Load unclustered identities
    Svc->>Svc: Load cluster data (reps, centroids)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over RepDisc,GraphDisc: DISCOVERY PHASE (No assignments)
        Svc->>RepDisc: discover(identities, representatives)
        RepDisc-->>Svc: candidates[] with discovery_similarity
        
        Svc->>CentDisc: discover(remaining, centroids)
        CentDisc-->>Svc: candidates[] with discovery_similarity
        
        Svc->>GraphDisc: discover(still_remaining, anchors)
        GraphDisc-->>Svc: candidates[] + new_cluster_proposals[]
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Gate,Suggest: EVALUATION PHASE (Single gate)
        loop each candidate
            Svc->>Gate: evaluate(candidate)
            
            Gate->>Checks: MaturityCheck (≥2 diverse reps?)
            Checks-->>Gate: pass/fail
            
            Gate->>Checks: CompleteLinkCheck (match ALL reps?)
            Checks-->>Gate: pass/fail + min_sim, avg_sim
            
            Gate->>Checks: MemberDistributionCheck (avg member sim?)
            Checks-->>Gate: pass/fail
            
            Gate->>Checks: ConfidenceCheck (discovery_sim threshold?)
            Checks-->>Gate: pass/fail
            
            alt All checks pass
                Gate-->>Svc: ACCEPT
                Svc->>Writer: assign(candidate)
                Writer->>DB: INSERT identity_member
            else Borderline (suggestion tier)
                Gate-->>Svc: SUGGEST (confidence=0.7)
                Svc->>Suggest: create(candidate, confidence)
                Suggest->>DB: INSERT identity_suggestion
            else Fatal failure
                Gate-->>Svc: REJECT (reason="immature cluster")
                Note over Svc: Identity stays unclustered
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Svc,DB: NEW CLUSTER CREATION
        Svc->>Svc: Create clusters for still-unclustered
        Svc->>DB: INSERT identity_cluster, identity_member
    end
```
